WEBVTT

00:08.040 --> 00:10.440
I've...

00:10.440 --> 00:12.070
...decided...

00:13.880 --> 00:15.710
...which friend to kill...

00:17.750 --> 00:19.580
...and in turn...

00:21.050 --> 00:23.040
...what is to be protected.

00:43.870 --> 00:45.940
"Imperial Era 3015"

00:45.940 --> 00:49.740
"Nil Kamui-Shuka outskirts \ Orphanage"

00:50.210 --> 00:53.280
Mashiro, is the food ready?

00:53.280 --> 00:54.950
I'm starving!

00:54.950 --> 00:57.650
--Hold on, just a second!
--Starving!

00:57.650 --> 00:59.640
Can you line the plates?

01:12.630 --> 01:14.130
Hm?

01:15.900 --> 01:18.670
Kai, stop with the violence.

01:18.670 --> 01:22.130
But Ibuki, this brat...

01:23.810 --> 01:26.810
...was saying that our country was defeated!

01:30.090 --> 01:33.590
The name of our country is Nil Kamui.

01:33.590 --> 01:36.420
It's a small island country.

01:36.420 --> 01:42.860
One day, the covetous, great ancient country of Kouran conducted a sudden invasion

01:42.860 --> 01:46.600
and plundered a third of the land.

01:46.600 --> 01:49.970
Our ally, the great country to the east, D'natia,

01:49.970 --> 01:54.780
defended settlements where they had their bases, then kept silent.

01:54.780 --> 01:58.610
The two great countries quickly carved away Nil Kamui's lands

01:58.610 --> 02:03.120
like meat from a sacrificial swine.

02:03.120 --> 02:07.990
Furthermore, the island's guardian deity,
Red Dragon, suddenly went mad

02:07.990 --> 02:12.990
and began indiscriminately burning villages and killing people.

02:12.990 --> 02:15.630
If we accept our defeat...

02:15.630 --> 02:18.030
...there's no way we can face...

02:18.030 --> 02:20.500
...our fathers and everyone else!

02:20.500 --> 02:22.900
Even so, violence is wrong.

02:25.510 --> 02:27.880
Come now, Kai.

02:27.880 --> 02:30.510
If you say so, Ibuki.

02:30.510 --> 02:32.410
I was wrong.

02:32.410 --> 02:33.900
Sorry.

02:34.980 --> 02:37.690
Now then, it's time to eat!

02:37.690 --> 02:39.310
Yay!

02:41.490 --> 02:46.530
Isn't the first huge market in a long time being held tomorrow?

02:46.530 --> 02:48.860
How about we go shopping together?

02:48.860 --> 02:50.030
Thank you.

02:50.030 --> 02:52.530
But Kai, you alone would be...

02:52.530 --> 02:55.870
Ah, Kai alone isn't enough to carry the load, right?

02:55.870 --> 02:59.410
C'mon, I can handle myself.

02:59.410 --> 03:01.240
Thank you, Ibuki.

03:05.210 --> 03:08.380
"Same day, same time

03:05.210 --> 03:08.380
Nil Kamui \ Shuka naval port"

03:13.920 --> 03:17.230
Hurry it up, you lazy bums!

03:17.230 --> 03:20.720
We need to leave Shuka tomorrow.

03:22.760 --> 03:24.600
Damn, Kouran...

03:30.640 --> 03:34.040
The people of this country are quite the laggards.

03:34.040 --> 03:38.910
They boldly complain, despite not being able to make decisions on their own.

03:43.220 --> 03:44.290
Please, spare me!

03:44.290 --> 03:46.960
Do not worry...

03:46.960 --> 03:49.560
Your life will serve for the better of this item of greater importance--

03:49.560 --> 03:51.050
Kohretsu.

03:52.930 --> 03:57.330
There are no problems in transporting our "means" against Red Dragon, yes?

03:57.330 --> 04:00.770
Yes, Lady Kohkaku!
No delays whatsoever!

04:00.770 --> 04:02.770
Hurry them up.

04:02.770 --> 04:08.080
Kouran is apparently planning to deploy an expedition for the Red Dragon.

04:08.080 --> 04:10.680
Which means we must stop
Red Dragon before them,

04:10.680 --> 04:13.580
lest we be branded as incompetent.

04:13.580 --> 04:19.580
We are the rulers of this island, and not those back in our country.

04:20.590 --> 04:24.030
"Nil Kamui \ Shuka

04:20.590 --> 04:24.030
Temple in Kouran's territory"

04:24.330 --> 04:27.630
I'm surprised to see you here.

04:27.630 --> 04:30.130
So, about this "Red Dragon expedition"...

04:30.130 --> 04:33.120
I see you came up with something interesting again.

04:34.370 --> 04:36.370
Why, of course.

04:36.370 --> 04:42.510
Red Dragon is quite a nuisance to Kouran, see?

04:42.510 --> 04:48.820
And I figured you would be a perfect fit for this, Lou.

04:48.820 --> 04:50.650
Scary, scary...

04:55.560 --> 04:59.120
"The next day \ Nil Kamui \ Shuka outskirts"

05:00.400 --> 05:03.130
"Cave near the orphanage"

05:21.550 --> 05:25.520
Please listen to our earnest prayers...

05:25.520 --> 05:31.860
Purify and cleanse us of our sins...

05:31.860 --> 05:34.850
May the divine blessing of
Red Dragon be upon you all!

05:39.900 --> 05:41.600
Where might he be?

05:41.600 --> 05:44.270
He's at the orphanage's training hall.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.760
I see...

06:11.870 --> 06:13.460
Fugaku?!

06:16.240 --> 06:18.870
Why lower your sword?

06:18.870 --> 06:23.210
It's because I'm not training to fight.

06:23.210 --> 06:25.410
You haven't changed a bit.

06:27.950 --> 06:33.820
So, you have no intention of succeeding your father after all.

06:33.820 --> 06:38.590
Nil Kamui doesn't need a king anymore...

06:38.590 --> 06:40.130
If a king...

06:40.130 --> 06:42.260
If someone from the Imperial lineage

06:42.260 --> 06:45.630
rose to power, that power would bring conflict along with it.

06:45.630 --> 06:47.770
I understand your take on the matter, but...

06:47.770 --> 06:49.570
Ibuki!

06:49.570 --> 06:50.670
Sorry for the wait!

06:50.670 --> 06:53.010
Huh? Is it time already?

06:53.010 --> 06:54.500
Are you going to the market?

06:55.740 --> 06:57.340
If so...

06:58.980 --> 07:01.680
...at least for today...

07:01.680 --> 07:03.790
...take this with you.

07:03.790 --> 07:05.820
Your father would be pleased.

07:05.820 --> 07:09.590
But why wear the Ryugatou now?

07:09.590 --> 07:15.700
Even if you won't rise as king, I'd like to see you dressed for the affair today.

07:15.700 --> 07:17.700
Understood.

07:17.700 --> 07:19.800
Fugaku, will you be coming to the market, too?

07:19.800 --> 07:22.170
Hm? Well, yes...

07:22.170 --> 07:25.310
Then I'll be heading out ahead with Mashiro.

07:25.310 --> 07:26.840
Let's meet there.

07:26.840 --> 07:28.470
Excuse us.

07:32.880 --> 07:36.050
Forgive me, Ibuki...

07:36.050 --> 07:39.350
I will be plunging you into battle...

07:52.170 --> 07:55.300
Whoa! This place is so lively!

07:55.300 --> 07:57.670
It hasn't been like this in ages!

07:57.670 --> 08:00.480
Yup, you look good with it after all.

08:00.480 --> 08:02.510
Huh?

08:02.510 --> 08:04.340
The Ryugatou.

08:05.580 --> 08:10.590
You're really starting to take after your father.

08:10.590 --> 08:12.580
Those days are over already.

08:16.390 --> 08:18.380
You're really kind, Ibuki.

08:23.830 --> 08:25.870
I-I'm so sorry.

08:25.870 --> 08:29.400
Apologies from me, too. Are you okay?

08:29.400 --> 08:30.400
Yes.

08:30.400 --> 08:33.070
We're really sorry.

08:33.070 --> 08:34.710
No problem at all.

08:34.710 --> 08:37.180
Well, if you'll excuse us...

08:43.950 --> 08:47.190
So, this is Nil Kamui?

08:47.190 --> 08:49.290
Everything I see here is new to me.

08:49.290 --> 08:50.790
Awesome!

08:50.790 --> 08:53.960
This island is filled with so many things
I haven't seen before.

08:53.960 --> 08:56.600
Ah, the air is so fresh, isn't it, Meryl?

08:56.600 --> 08:58.370
Sir Sweallow...

08:58.370 --> 09:04.210
May I ask that you please read the situation instead of just breathing the air here?

09:04.210 --> 09:10.810
Please listen. The tension of war still lingers in this country, and--

09:10.810 --> 09:12.650
You're so kind, Meryl.

09:12.650 --> 09:15.820
Uh, I wasn't trying to be kind.

09:15.820 --> 09:19.320
Um, Sir Sweallow?

09:19.320 --> 09:24.960
Are you seriously going to join the Red Dragon expedition and bear their mission?

09:24.960 --> 09:26.460
Of course!

09:26.460 --> 09:29.330
That is my contract with Black Dragon, after all.

09:32.570 --> 09:34.970
Don't worry. I'm sure it'll be fun.

09:43.440 --> 09:44.750
Just a bit more!

09:44.750 --> 09:49.980
I'll buy in bulk, so will you please drop the price a bit more?

09:49.980 --> 09:51.820
I give up.

09:51.820 --> 09:53.450
Hm?

09:55.760 --> 09:57.860
Move aside!

09:57.860 --> 10:01.350
Kouran's Leader of Five Thousand will pass through shortly!

10:03.800 --> 10:07.170
Kouran's troops...

10:14.310 --> 10:20.270
If our march weren't so hurried, we wouldn't have had to pass through this slum.

10:21.280 --> 10:24.990
This treasure, the Dragon Eye, allows sharing of thoughts with the dragons

10:24.990 --> 10:29.990
and is our means against Red Dragon.

10:29.990 --> 10:32.330
So bear this march, Kohretsu.

10:32.330 --> 10:35.820
Understood, Lady Kohkaku.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.730
What's the matter, Ibuki?

10:46.340 --> 10:49.900
One fit to be the king of Nil Kamui...

11:00.720 --> 11:03.160
Th-This is...?

11:03.160 --> 11:05.850
Pledge yourself to me.

11:07.400 --> 11:11.260
Achieve that which you desire.

11:17.870 --> 11:21.600
"Nil Kamui \ A small island country located between

11:17.870 --> 11:21.600
two great opposing countries, Kouran and D'natia.

11:17.870 --> 11:21.600
The island is noted for its tropical weather, vast

11:17.870 --> 11:21.600
wasteland, jungles, and rugged volcanic areas."

11:22.880 --> 11:25.380
Listen all!

11:25.380 --> 11:29.780
Making grace here is Kouran Jinrai prefecture's Shinbu Shogun!

11:29.780 --> 11:32.550
Leader of Five Thousand, Lady Kohkaku!

11:32.550 --> 11:37.460
Lady Kohkaku has graciously organized a force to hunt down

11:37.460 --> 11:42.760
the giant lizard Red Dragon thriving in this savage country, Nil Kamui!

11:42.760 --> 11:46.470
As you all know, the last war marked the start

11:46.470 --> 11:49.940
of Red Dragon's brutal attacks upon the people and towns.

11:49.940 --> 11:51.810
But do not fear!

11:51.810 --> 11:55.110
We will destroy it with the Dragon Eye

11:55.110 --> 11:58.450
and bring peace back to this island!

11:58.450 --> 11:59.450
The Dragon Eye?

11:59.450 --> 12:02.150
--Seriously?
--That's supposed to be Nil Kamui's treasure...

12:02.150 --> 12:03.780
And so...

12:09.590 --> 12:12.660
You there, boy.

12:12.660 --> 12:14.650
Are you referring to me?

12:16.930 --> 12:19.630
Why do you still wear a sword on you?

12:19.630 --> 12:25.310
The peace treaty enacted forbids citizens of Nil Kamui to wield swords.

12:25.310 --> 12:28.740
This island is now under the protection of Kouran.

12:28.740 --> 12:31.010
Swords are not needed anymore, yes?

12:31.010 --> 12:33.950
The Ryugatou...

12:33.950 --> 12:35.250
...is worn as a courtesy.

12:35.250 --> 12:38.120
I am not questioning the purpose of the blade.

12:38.120 --> 12:40.350
I am telling you to discard the sword.

12:40.350 --> 12:41.820
Don't do it, Ibuki!

12:41.820 --> 12:44.760
Don't ever get rid of the Ryugatou!

12:44.760 --> 12:48.700
It's the very soul of Nil Kamui!

12:48.700 --> 12:51.500
A sword is just...

12:51.500 --> 12:53.100
...a mass of iron.

12:53.100 --> 12:55.470
Mashiro!

12:55.470 --> 12:59.170
What's the matter, boy? Can't get rid of it?

12:59.170 --> 13:03.180
Is that mass of iron you have of greater importance than your life?

13:03.180 --> 13:07.720
Ibuki...

13:07.720 --> 13:09.380
It's okay.

13:09.380 --> 13:11.350
That's right.

13:11.350 --> 13:15.120
Pride without strength is of no use.

13:22.960 --> 13:25.400
I•••

13:25.400 --> 13:27.230
What's the matter?

13:30.370 --> 13:33.140
We don't need a king anymore...

13:37.040 --> 13:39.510
Can't discard it, can you?

13:39.510 --> 13:44.320
I was going to assign you as my attendant, but at this point, you leave me no choice.

13:49.420 --> 13:51.050
What is it?

13:52.560 --> 13:54.320
Divine punishment!

13:55.530 --> 13:58.520
Set the flames of revolution!

14:01.370 --> 14:04.570
The time has arrived, Lord Ibuki!

14:04.570 --> 14:07.110
Armed savages have appeared from the rear!

14:07.110 --> 14:08.940
Is it the rebels?!

14:20.420 --> 14:22.120
A Bound One?!

14:22.120 --> 14:25.290
Leave it to the savages to use ones so lowly!

14:35.900 --> 14:39.110
All that move are to be treated as rebels!

14:39.110 --> 14:42.470
Heed my words! Kill all those of Nil Kamui!

14:59.460 --> 15:03.120
No... Why is this happening?!

15:07.270 --> 15:09.260
Val, let's begin.

15:21.920 --> 15:24.590
If you don't move aside, you'll die.

15:24.590 --> 15:28.020
What haughty words coming from the likes of a rebel!

15:38.700 --> 15:40.330
Ibuki...

15:44.270 --> 15:47.540
At least for today, take this with you...

15:47.540 --> 15:49.540
Your father would be pleased.

15:49.540 --> 15:51.310
Fugaku...

15:51.310 --> 15:53.300
Did he plan for this?

16:06.730 --> 16:08.360
Ibuki!

16:11.470 --> 16:13.170
I see!

16:13.170 --> 16:16.870
So, you were seeking the Dragon Eye all along.

16:18.970 --> 16:23.710
How dare you bring this about, you lowly savage?!

16:23.710 --> 16:26.680
What do you mean, "savage"?!

16:29.880 --> 16:33.180
One fit to be the king of Nil Kamui...

16:36.360 --> 16:38.550
Kai! Run!

16:47.770 --> 16:50.240
Mashiro!

16:52.710 --> 16:54.540
This can't be...

16:58.510 --> 17:01.110
I'll make you pay for what you did to Mashiro!

17:04.350 --> 17:05.840
Kai!

17:07.090 --> 17:09.560
What a nuisance...

17:31.110 --> 17:33.580
What should I do?

17:34.880 --> 17:40.120
I thought becoming a king would bring about war again...

17:40.120 --> 17:41.660
They're still inside!

17:41.660 --> 17:43.920
Your father and family are already...!

17:43.920 --> 17:46.490
Kouran's army is closing in!

17:46.490 --> 17:47.900
Now hurry!

17:47.900 --> 17:52.230
I thought Nil Kamui didn't need a king anymore...

17:52.230 --> 17:55.770
I thought the existence of a king prevented war from ending...

17:55.770 --> 17:59.800
But war followed me...

18:04.080 --> 18:08.280
Am I again unable to do anything?

18:08.280 --> 18:11.250
Pledge yourself to me, Imperial.

18:13.990 --> 18:18.160
Present me an offering, and pledge yourself to me.

18:18.160 --> 18:22.160
Etch into the world what you desire.

18:22.160 --> 18:23.700
Pledge...

18:23.700 --> 18:26.170
Your pledge, Imperial.

18:26.170 --> 18:32.470
With your resolve, I shall grant you the powers of the dragon.

18:32.470 --> 18:34.540
Pledge...

18:34.540 --> 18:36.680
If I enter into a contract with you...

18:36.680 --> 18:40.810
Will everyone... Will Mashiro be saved?

18:43.980 --> 18:45.450
Yes.

18:45.450 --> 18:50.120
If that is what you so desire.

18:50.120 --> 18:52.190
I•••

18:52.190 --> 18:54.460
...want to...

18:54.460 --> 18:56.300
...change this world!

18:56.300 --> 19:00.860
Your wish will be granted.

19:08.340 --> 19:10.640
Am I...

19:10.640 --> 19:12.680
...going to die?

19:12.680 --> 19:16.550
I'll never let that happen!

19:16.550 --> 19:17.650
Ibuki...

19:17.650 --> 19:20.550
Red Dragon! Hurry!

19:20.550 --> 19:22.920
Hurry and save Mashiro!

19:27.330 --> 19:29.400
My hand...

19:29.400 --> 19:33.100
Offer to me an equivalent

19:33.100 --> 19:36.500
and achieve your desire.

19:36.500 --> 19:38.370
N-No!

19:38.370 --> 19:41.500
Wh-Why do I...?!

19:42.680 --> 19:47.410
You made a pledge with Red Dragon.

19:47.410 --> 19:49.020
Mashiro...

19:49.020 --> 19:52.890
This is what it means to make a pledge with Red Dragon.

19:52.890 --> 19:55.090
I'm so happy.

19:55.090 --> 19:59.390
I'm able to offer my life to you, Ibuki.

19:59.390 --> 20:03.560
A Child of Contract converts the souls of those they are bonded to into a blade,

20:03.560 --> 20:06.030
delivering countries from crisis.

20:06.030 --> 20:09.130
It's exactly according to legend...

20:11.470 --> 20:12.710
Stop!

20:12.710 --> 20:15.410
Stop! Please stop!

20:15.410 --> 20:17.140
Don't cry...

20:17.140 --> 20:18.910
Don't worry...

20:18.910 --> 20:22.380
Ibuki, I'll always be on your side, so...

20:19.880 --> 20:24.650
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

20:24.650 --> 20:29.090
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

20:25.050 --> 20:28.590
...please be a good king...

20:29.090 --> 20:31.220
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

20:36.230 --> 20:38.630
The pledge has been fulfilled.

20:42.000 --> 20:51.350
<i>My shout added to the noise</i>

20:42.000 --> 20:51.350
<i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

20:42.300 --> 20:46.110
I shall accept you as
Nil Kamui's Child of Contract.

20:50.910 --> 20:53.080
Found you, brat!

20:51.350 --> 20:52.350
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

20:52.350 --> 20:54.450
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

20:54.450 --> 20:57.520
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

20:57.520 --> 20:59.750
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

20:59.750 --> 21:01.960
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

21:01.960 --> 21:06.190
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

21:06.190 --> 21:12.430
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

21:08.760 --> 21:11.630
You monster!

21:12.430 --> 21:17.940
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i>

21:12.430 --> 21:17.940
<i>moment with my own hands"</i>

21:14.430 --> 21:15.970
Silence!

21:17.370 --> 21:20.610
In the name of the Child of Contract and of Red Dragon...

21:17.940 --> 21:23.010
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

21:23.010 --> 21:28.680
<i>I left my hopes to an</i>

21:23.010 --> 21:28.680
<i>undependable past and vanished</i>

21:24.380 --> 21:26.850
...perish!

21:28.680 --> 21:34.290
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

21:29.820 --> 21:32.290
Th-This is a Dragon's...!

21:34.290 --> 21:38.330
<i>The ending world</i>

21:38.330 --> 21:43.200
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

21:41.700 --> 21:45.790
Young girl, this battle will be placed on hold for now.

21:50.640 --> 21:52.140
That's...

21:52.140 --> 21:53.970
I see...

21:55.310 --> 21:58.750
I think I understand a bit more about why I was called.

21:58.750 --> 22:02.020
Black Dragon is quite a trickster.

22:02.020 --> 22:05.590
My lord, that is an Imperial...

22:05.590 --> 22:08.720
The one who carries the blood of the king of this country.

22:08.720 --> 22:10.590
I can see that, Lou.

22:10.590 --> 22:12.660
It seems quite delicious...

22:12.660 --> 22:13.990
Indeed...

22:13.990 --> 22:16.860
To find prey such as that on this island was unexpected.

22:39.790 --> 22:43.190
Did Mashiro die?

22:43.190 --> 22:44.690
Who are you?

22:44.690 --> 22:46.290
I'm Eykha...

22:46.290 --> 22:48.730
...a member of the revolution.

22:48.730 --> 22:50.860
Who are you?

22:50.860 --> 22:54.400
I'm Ibuki.

22:54.400 --> 22:56.030
This island's...

22:58.440 --> 22:59.930
Mashiro...

23:05.610 --> 23:07.440
I•••

23:10.050 --> 23:13.040
...will become king of this island.

23:15.920 --> 23:16.390
"Act 1"

23:17.320 --> 23:20.590
"Act 1 \ Kill One to Save Many"

23:26.900 --> 23:27.270
"Act 2"

23:26.970 --> 23:30.440
Act 2: "Antinomy."

23:30.440 --> 23:34.610
The powerful members of the combined expedition appear...

23:34.610 --> 23:38.840
A friend must be killed to save another.
